UNDERSTANDING.md

# M7: services/backend-api/static/ holds the built frontend (dist/)
# inside the collapsed frontend+backend image (see the root Dockerfile,
# Task 3). Locally it holds only a placeholder index.html so main.py can
# be imported without a real `npm run build` -- keep the assets/
# directory itself (via .gitkeep) so StaticFiles' mount doesn't fail at
# import time, but never commit the placeholder or a locally-built copy.
services/backend-api/static/*
!services/backend-api/static/assets/
services/backend-api/static/assets/*
!services/backend-api/static/assets/.gitkeep